    "Remark 16.",
    "Reference  considered the problem of exponential 1 output tracking control for positive switched linear systems with ADT, which focuses on the asymptotic stability and the exponential 1 performance index.",
    "There are some differences between  and this paper.",
    "Firstly, the finite-time stability in this paper and the asymptotic stability in  are two absolutely different concepts.",
    "Secondly, the performance indexes are also different.",
    "Finally, this paper uses MDADT approach instead of ADT method in [6] .",
    "So we do not compare the simulation rets."
